  "nonlinear_category_reason": "Scene order runs from the latest stretch to the earliest throughout, with no present-day level the telling returns to. Six months of a schoolgirl friendship unwind from the two girls having nothing to say to each other back to the day they both passed the same exam.",
  "syuzhet_notes": "The telling runs backwards in dated blocks from the estrangement to the examination result, so the audience meets the two girls as near strangers and only gradually learns what they had been to each other.",
  "fabula_notes": "Chronology is fixed by captions. Each block plays forward within itself, so the reversal operates at the level of the blocks.",
